public

.DS_Store

# Zola <=0.22 wrote these into static/ on build; 0.23 writes them to the output dir.
# Kept as a guard: a leftover copy here shadows the generated one and breaks highlighting.
static/giallo-*.css

# Lighthouse CI reports (validate.yml, or `npx @lhci/cli autorun` locally).
.lighthouseci/

# Figures of the /performance/ page: written on each deploy by
# scripts/performance_data.py from that deploy's Lighthouse run.
content/pages/performance/data.json
